'''2.''' Loosely, any blood-vessel. {{smaller|Many of the veins being superficial or subcutaneous, liable to ordinary observation, and when swollen or congested very conspicuous, the name is popularized, and extended to the arteries, while ''artery'' remains chiefly a technical term.}}

